---
description: Ambient .d.ts files always live in an @types folder
globs: "**/*.d.ts"
alwaysApply: true
---

# Declaration files

Ambient TypeScript declarations (`.d.ts`) always live in a folder named `@types`, colocated with the owning package or FSD layer.

```
apps/web/src/app/@types/
  i18next.d.ts
  virtual-web-config.d.ts

packages/frontend/core/src/@types/   # if a package needs ambient types
```

Do not drop `.d.ts` files at `src/` root or next to runtime modules.

```typescript
// ❌ apps/web/src/i18next.d.ts
// ❌ apps/web/src/app/virtual-web-config.d.ts

// ✅ apps/web/src/app/@types/i18next.d.ts
```

Enforced by ESLint `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/dts-in-types-folder`.
